    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is performance marketing for jewellery in Dammam?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Full-funnel Meta + Google + Shopping + PMax + Snapchat (GCC) + WhatsApp CTWA + concierge + LTV/CAC/cohort + multi-touch attribution + offline conversion upload + wedding-season concentration. For jewellery in Dammam, high-AOV, longer sales cycle, WhatsApp concierge integration, and wedding-season concentration are performance-marketing multipliers."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What full-funnel channel mix for jewellery in Dammam?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Awareness 20-25%: Reels + TikTok + YouTube + PR + editorial + celebrity + bridal magazine. Consideration 25-30%: Meta Advantage+ Shopping + Google Shopping + Pinterest + creator UGC + Snapchat (GCC). Conversion 30-35%: Meta catalog + Google Search + brand + WhatsApp CTWA + concierge close. Retention 15-20%: Klaviyo + WhatsApp restock + drop + wedding-anniversary + Karva Chauth + Dhanteras + buyback + upgrade. In Dammam with Ramadan + Eid + Saudi National Day + wedding season + oil-industry annual bonus cycle (Q4), wedding + Akshaya Tritiya + Dhanteras + Diwali concentration especially strong."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What LTV/CAC + payback benchmarks for jewellery in Dammam?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Targets: LTV/CAC 4:1 minimum, 8:1 target, 15:1+ mature (highest LTV of D2C categories). Payback 6-14 months (slower than fashion/skincare due to higher inventory + longer purchase-consideration cycle). First-order CPA: fashion + gold-plated SAR 300-1,000, fine gold + diamond SAR 800-3,500, bridal + solitaire SAR 2,000-15,000. 5-year LTV: fashion + silver SAR 25K-2L, fine gold + diamond SAR 1-8L, bridal + solitaire + investment SAR 5-40L. In Dammam, wedding cohorts show 3-5x LTV multiplier — bridal buyer becomes anniversary + Karva Chauth + Dhanteras + festival LTV compound."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do cohort + attribution reporting work for jewellery?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Weekly cohort: first-purchase → month-3 repeat → month-12 anniversary/festival → 5-year LTV. Attribution: GA4 + Meta CAPI + Google Enhanced Conversions + WhatsApp CTWA + Shopify order-level + offline conversion upload (concierge/phone close) + Triple Whale/Northbeam. Jewellery-specific: multi-touch attribution (8-15 touchpoints over 2-8 weeks pre-purchase), phone/WhatsApp close attribution via offline conversion upload, wedding cohort long-term tracking. Weekly QBR: channel + creative + audience + collection + campaign level ROAS + CAC + LTV/CAC."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Google + Meta + Shopping + PMax allocation for jewellery?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Growth-tier: Meta Advantage+ Shopping 25-30%, Google Shopping + PMax 20-25%, Google Search (brand + non-brand) 20-25%, Meta catalog retargeting 10-15%, YouTube 5-10%, Pinterest 5-10% (bridal + wedding), WhatsApp CTWA + concierge 10-15%. PMax excellent for jewellery: complete catalog + AR/video assets + audience signals + LTV-weighted goals + LTV bidding. In Dammam, allocation shifts Snapchat 15-25% for KSA, WhatsApp 15-20% for high-AOV bridal + solitaire."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"WhatsApp + retention role in jewellery performance marketing?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"WhatsApp CTWA + concierge drives 30-50% of high-AOV jewellery inquiry + close (SAR 25,000+ AOV). Concierge-close conversions require offline conversion upload to Meta + Google. WhatsApp Cloud API runs: welcome, abandoned cart, restock, drop, wedding-anniversary + Karva Chauth + Dhanteras + Diwali reminders, buyback + upgrade programme, styling consultation, insurance renewal, care + cleaning reminders. Retention delivers 40-60% of month-24+ revenue for well-executed jewellery brands."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"When to add Snapchat + TikTok for jewellery in Dammam?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GCC: Snapchat day 30-60 for KSA (20-30% fashion + gold-plated + youth jewellery). Snapchat lower share than fashion/skincare (jewellery buyer skews older, less Snapchat-native). TikTok day 30-60 for UAE/GCC (10-15% for youth-fashion jewellery). India: TikTok month 3-6 for fashion jewellery + Gen Z (5-10%). Snapchat rarely justified India jewellery. In Dammam, add channels 1 at a time + optimise 4-8 weeks."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Advantage+ Shopping best practices for jewellery?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Complete catalog feed with jewellery attributes (metal + karat + gemstone + gemstone-type + size + weight + design-family). 15-25+ creative assets (360-spin + macro + styling + creator UGC + editorial). Audience signals: existing customer + LAL + high-intent + interest (jewellery + wedding + gifting). Enable existing customer expansion + value-based bidding. Weekly creative refresh (jewellery buyer researches longer, less fatigued — 4-6 week refresh cycle works). Segment PMax by AOV tier + wedding-cohort via custom labels. In Dammam, wedding-collection PMax campaigns during Ramadan + Eid + Saudi National Day + wedding season + oil-industry annual bonus cycle (Q4) drive 3-5x baseline daily performance."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Creative + audience + measurement pillars for jewellery performance marketing?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Creative: 8-18 units/week Growth-tier (360-spin + macro + Reels + creator + celebrity + editorial + heritage + bridal). Audience: LAL of high-AOV customers + wedding-shoppers + gifting + regional-heritage segments. Measurement: LTV/CAC/cohort with 5-year horizon, ROAS by channel + creative + collection, first-purchase vs LTV split, wedding-cohort long-term tracking + concierge-close attribution. In Dammam, Saudi Aramco + oil-sector expat + South Asian + Filipino + Arab expat, high disposable income + Ramadan + Eid + Saudi National Day + wedding season + oil-industry annual bonus cycle (Q4) inform audience + creative + measurement segmentation."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Common jewellery performance marketing mistakes in Dammam?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"(1) Optimising CPA vs LTV. (2) Missing offline conversion upload for phone/WhatsApp concierge close (30-50% attribution loss). (3) Weak multi-touch attribution (jewellery buyer touches 8-15 times over 2-8 weeks). (4) No WhatsApp CTWA + concierge (misses 30-50% high-AOV close). (5) Under-invested creator + celebrity + editorial. (6) Same audience + creative for fashion + gold-plated + bridal. (7) English-only creative GCC. (8) Ignoring wedding + festive concentration (Ramadan + Eid + Saudi National Day + wedding season + oil-industry annual bonus cycle (Q4)). (9) No AR try-on integration in ads. (10) Weak BIS HUID + certification display in creatives. (11) Not scaling Snapchat KSA for fashion + gold-plated. (12) No 5-year LTV cohort visibility."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Scaling jewellery from SAR 10L to SAR 5 crore/month timeline in Dammam?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"24-36 months well-executed. Slower than fashion/skincare due to higher inventory intensity + longer purchase-consideration cycle. Transitions: (a) SAR 10L → 30L: broaden channel mix, creative velocity 6-12/week, WhatsApp concierge programme, first cohort dashboard. (b) SAR 30L → 1 Cr: add multi-touch attribution + offline conversion upload, creator + celebrity + wedding-industry, LTV bidding. (c) SAR 1 Cr → 3 Cr: add GCC/multi-region + trilingual + AR + home-trial programme + Enterprise attribution. (d) SAR 3-5 Cr: full multi-channel + multi-region + editorial + PR + celebrity + investor-grade reporting."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does ITD GrowthLabs run jewellery performance marketing in Dammam?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Full-stack: channel mix (Meta + Google + Shopping + PMax + Snapchat GCC + WhatsApp CTWA + concierge), creative production (in-house pod, 360-spin + macro capability), attribution stack + offline conversion upload + LTV/CAC/cohort reporting (5-year horizon), wedding + Akshaya Tritiya + Dhanteras + Diwali campaigns, celebrity + editorial + PR + wedding-industry partnerships. Grounded in ITD's 50-piece jewellery cluster + Fabelia case study . See Digital Marketing for Jewellery Brands . Retainer starts at SAR 3,500-16,000 + ad spend transparent pass-through."}}]}</script>
