      <h1>Jewellery Brand Performance Marketing in Dammam 2026 &mdash; Complete FAQ</h1>
      <p class="lede">12 answer-first Q&amp;As on performance marketing (google + meta + shopping + pmax) for jewellery + fine jewellery brands in Dammam, Saudi Arabia &mdash; costs in SAR, compliance (SFDA + SASO), channels, timelines, and how ITD GrowthLabs approaches this work.</p>
